   "solution": "$R_2 \\to R_2 - R_1$ gives $[1\\;3\\;1]$, so $B = E^{-1}A$ with $E^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$. Since $EB = A$, $E$ undoes the operation: $E$ is the matrix of $R_2 \\to R_2 + R_1$."
