   "solution": "If $Yv=0$ then $Av=X(Yv)=0$. Conversely, if $Av=0$ then $X(Yv)=0$, and since $X$ has full column rank (independent columns), $Yv=0$. So $\\operatorname{null}A=\\operatorname{null}Y$.\n\nExplicitly, $Yv=0$ reads $v_1=v_4$, $v_2=0$, $v_3=-3v_4$, so $\\operatorname{null}Y=\\operatorname{span}\\{(1,0,-3,1)^T\\}$. Directly, $A(1,0,-3,1)^T=(1-9+8,\\,-1+0+1,\\,0-3+3,\\,1+6-7)^T=0$, and $\\operatorname{rank}A=3$ gives $\\dim\\operatorname{null}A=1$, so the two null spaces agree."
