   "setup": "Let $A, B \\in M_{m \\times k}(\\mathbb{F})$. Suppose $\\operatorname{col} A = \\operatorname{col} B$. Prove that there is an invertible matrix $C \\in M_k$ such that $A = BC$.\n*Here is a proof. Justify each step.*",
