   "context": "Let $A, B \\in M_{m \\times n}$ and suppose that $r = \\operatorname{rank} A \\geq 1$. Show that the following are equivalent:\n(a) $\\operatorname{col} A = \\operatorname{col} B$.\n(b) There are full-rank matrices $X \\in M_{m \\times r}$ and $Y, Z \\in M_{r \\times n}$ such that $A = XY$ and $B = XZ$.\n(c) There is an invertible $S \\in M_n$ such that $B = AS$.",
