   "text": "Compute the rank of\n$$A = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 3 & 1 & 5 & 0 & 5 & 1 & 4 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 3 & 3 & 2 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0 & 1 & 5 & 3 & 3 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 5 & 0 & 2 & 0 & 2 & 0 & 4 & 3 \\end{bmatrix}.$$",
